cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "tnwf — Scalable quantum simulation of continuous-time generative models via tensor networks"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for "Scalable quantum simulation of continuous-time generative models
  via tensor networks": compressing the position-diagonal
  V-step of a wavefunction-flow evolution with tensor-network methods
  (TCI + TDVP).
type: software
